WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.464
Five days and nights brought
them to Port Adventure.

00:00:04.464 --> 00:00:07.714
Musgrave needed an arm
to reach Captain Cross’s house.

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:09.041
He could barely eat.

00:00:12.331 --> 00:00:15.347
In Invercargill, John Macpherson
walked the wet streets

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:17.397
collecting money for the return.

00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:20.234
People gave blankets
and clothes for the two men.

